[
  {
    "start": "00:00:00.000",
    "end": "00:00:07.000",
    "start_seconds": 0.0,
    "end_seconds": 7.0,
    "text": "Transcriber: Maki Sugimoto"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:03.583",
    "end": "00:00:05.335",
    "start_seconds": 3.583,
    "end_seconds": 5.335,
    "text": "Sometimes citizens think,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:05.335",
    "end": "00:00:08.964",
    "start_seconds": 5.335,
    "end_seconds": 8.964,
    "text": "“Oh, this is my personal problem or a personal issue."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:09.422",
    "end": "00:00:13.802",
    "start_seconds": 9.422,
    "end_seconds": 13.802,
    "text": "So it’s kind of a waste of time to speak up.”"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:13.843",
    "end": "00:00:15.136",
    "start_seconds": 13.843,
    "end_seconds": 15.136,
    "text": "But this is not true."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:15.512",
    "end": "00:00:20.850",
    "start_seconds": 15.512,
    "end_seconds": 20.85,
    "text": "If someone speaks up and others agree with it,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:20.850",
    "end": "00:00:24.646",
    "start_seconds": 20.85,
    "end_seconds": 24.646,
    "text": "that personal issue becomes social issue."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:25.021",
    "end": "00:00:26.940",
    "start_seconds": 25.021,
    "end_seconds": 26.94,
    "text": "With my administration,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:26.982",
    "end": "00:00:30.902",
    "start_seconds": 26.982,
    "end_seconds": 30.902,
    "text": "the city government actually did not make a town vision."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:31.778",
    "end": "00:00:37.033",
    "start_seconds": 31.778,
    "end_seconds": 37.033,
    "text": "Instead of that, citizens created the vision by themselves"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:37.075",
    "end": "00:00:42.038",
    "start_seconds": 37.075,
    "end_seconds": 42.038,
    "text": "and we, local government, supported the process,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:42.038",
    "end": "00:00:44.874",
    "start_seconds": 42.038,
    "end_seconds": 44.874,
    "text": "because [a] city is citizens --"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:46.251",
    "end": "00:00:48.545",
    "start_seconds": 46.251,
    "end_seconds": 48.545,
    "text": "[a] city is not the government."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:49.754",
    "end": "00:00:51.464",
    "start_seconds": 49.754,
    "end_seconds": 51.464,
    "text": "I am Takashima Ryosuke,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:51.506",
    "end": "00:00:53.508",
    "start_seconds": 51.506,
    "end_seconds": 53.508,
    "text": "the youngest mayor in Japanese history."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:54.092",
    "end": "00:00:56.052",
    "start_seconds": 54.092,
    "end_seconds": 56.052,
    "text": "I’m the mayor of Ashiya City."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:56.970",
    "end": "00:00:59.347",
    "start_seconds": 56.97,
    "end_seconds": 59.347,
    "text": "(Speaking in Japanese)"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:00.724",
    "end": "00:01:02.934",
    "start_seconds": 60.724,
    "end_seconds": 62.934,
    "text": "I’m a mayor, but I’m not a politician."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:03.435",
    "end": "00:01:06.563",
    "start_seconds": 63.435,
    "end_seconds": 66.563,
    "text": "My stance is actually very simple."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:06.563",
    "end": "00:01:10.817",
    "start_seconds": 66.563,
    "end_seconds": 70.81700000000001,
    "text": "I just listen to as many voices as possible,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:10.817",
    "end": "00:01:12.777",
    "start_seconds": 70.81700000000001,
    "end_seconds": 72.777,
    "text": "especially (from) younger generations."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:12.777",
    "end": "00:01:14.613",
    "start_seconds": 72.777,
    "end_seconds": 74.613,
    "text": "The reason is very simple:"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:14.654",
    "end": "00:01:18.199",
    "start_seconds": 74.654,
    "end_seconds": 78.199,
    "text": "students under 18 cannot vote."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:19.034",
    "end": "00:01:20.744",
    "start_seconds": 79.03399999999999,
    "end_seconds": 80.744,
    "text": "So I visited schools,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:20.785",
    "end": "00:01:23.246",
    "start_seconds": 80.785,
    "end_seconds": 83.246,
    "text": "like junior high schools and elementary schools,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:23.288",
    "end": "00:01:25.290",
    "start_seconds": 83.288,
    "end_seconds": 85.28999999999999,
    "text": "to hear their voices."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:25.332",
    "end": "00:01:31.046",
    "start_seconds": 85.332,
    "end_seconds": 91.04599999999999,
    "text": "But it’s so hard for kids, for students, to speak their opinions to a mayor --"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:31.087",
    "end": "00:01:33.381",
    "start_seconds": 91.087,
    "end_seconds": 93.381,
    "text": "even if I am the youngest mayor."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:33.840",
    "end": "00:01:37.302",
    "start_seconds": 93.84,
    "end_seconds": 97.30199999999999,
    "text": "So what I did was eat school lunch together,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:40.096",
    "end": "00:01:44.267",
    "start_seconds": 100.096,
    "end_seconds": 104.267,
    "text": "and I repeatedly visited schools."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:44.267",
    "end": "00:01:47.896",
    "start_seconds": 104.267,
    "end_seconds": 107.896,
    "text": "I didn’t want to be a formal visit,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:47.937",
    "end": "00:01:49.939",
    "start_seconds": 107.937,
    "end_seconds": 109.939,
    "text": "but rather a casual visit,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:49.981",
    "end": "00:01:53.234",
    "start_seconds": 109.981,
    "end_seconds": 113.23400000000001,
    "text": "casual chat with teachers and students."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:54.027",
    "end": "00:01:58.114",
    "start_seconds": 114.027,
    "end_seconds": 118.114,
    "text": "I could create the kind of friendly atmosphere,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:58.114",
    "end": "00:02:02.869",
    "start_seconds": 118.114,
    "end_seconds": 122.869,
    "text": "and I got more information rather than [in] a formal visit."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:03.244",
    "end": "00:02:08.958",
    "start_seconds": 123.244,
    "end_seconds": 128.958,
    "text": "For example, some students told me their school gym was so hot."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:08.958",
    "end": "00:02:13.713",
    "start_seconds": 128.958,
    "end_seconds": 133.713,
    "text": "So we decided to install air conditioners"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:13.755",
    "end": "00:02:16.049",
    "start_seconds": 133.755,
    "end_seconds": 136.049,
    "text": "in every single school gym."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:16.966",
    "end": "00:02:21.805",
    "start_seconds": 136.966,
    "end_seconds": 141.805,
    "text": "I wanted to make schools a place to learn and practice democracy."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:22.222",
    "end": "00:02:25.392",
    "start_seconds": 142.222,
    "end_seconds": 145.392,
    "text": "And it's all about communication and dialogue."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:26.267",
    "end": "00:02:31.648",
    "start_seconds": 146.267,
    "end_seconds": 151.648,
    "text": "I wanted to encourage people to speak up, listen to their voices,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:31.690",
    "end": "00:02:34.401",
    "start_seconds": 151.69,
    "end_seconds": 154.401,
    "text": "and then reflect their voices."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:34.442",
    "end": "00:02:38.363",
    "start_seconds": 154.442,
    "end_seconds": 158.363,
    "text": "The main method is holding dialogue meetings."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:38.655",
    "end": "00:02:42.992",
    "start_seconds": 158.655,
    "end_seconds": 162.992,
    "text": "It’s a meeting with me, mayor, and citizens"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:43.034",
    "end": "00:02:46.162",
    "start_seconds": 163.034,
    "end_seconds": 166.162,
    "text": "sit down together in a circle and talk with each other."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:46.621",
    "end": "00:02:51.167",
    "start_seconds": 166.621,
    "end_seconds": 171.167,
    "text": "And sometimes the mayor does not even speak up."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:51.543",
    "end": "00:02:56.923",
    "start_seconds": 171.543,
    "end_seconds": 176.923,
    "text": "Just listens or facilitates what citizens want to talk about."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:57.590",
    "end": "00:03:02.137",
    "start_seconds": 177.59,
    "end_seconds": 182.137,
    "text": "So, for example, Ashiya is a very healthy city."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:02.178",
    "end": "00:03:07.434",
    "start_seconds": 182.178,
    "end_seconds": 187.434,
    "text": "Recently, we had the world's oldest person in Ashiya city."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:07.434",
    "end": "00:03:11.771",
    "start_seconds": 187.434,
    "end_seconds": 191.77100000000002,
    "text": "Around 30 percent of the citizens are over 65."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:11.813",
    "end": "00:03:13.022",
    "start_seconds": 191.813,
    "end_seconds": 193.022,
    "text": "In the dialogue meetings,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:13.064",
    "end": "00:03:17.485",
    "start_seconds": 193.064,
    "end_seconds": 197.485,
    "text": "I heard elderly people say that the community centers were too busy"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:17.485",
    "end": "00:03:19.904",
    "start_seconds": 197.485,
    "end_seconds": 199.904,
    "text": "to answer their questions about care."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:20.363",
    "end": "00:03:24.075",
    "start_seconds": 200.363,
    "end_seconds": 204.075,
    "text": "So I wanted to increase the number of community centers,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:24.117",
    "end": "00:03:26.202",
    "start_seconds": 204.117,
    "end_seconds": 206.202,
    "text": "but we needed some budget."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:26.244",
    "end": "00:03:28.788",
    "start_seconds": 206.244,
    "end_seconds": 208.788,
    "text": "So before we had a monetary gift for elderly people,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:28.830",
    "end": "00:03:32.459",
    "start_seconds": 208.82999999999998,
    "end_seconds": 212.459,
    "text": "so we decided to change our monetary gift system,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:32.500",
    "end": "00:03:34.043",
    "start_seconds": 212.5,
    "end_seconds": 214.043,
    "text": "from a one-time monetary gift"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:34.085",
    "end": "00:03:36.838",
    "start_seconds": 214.085,
    "end_seconds": 216.838,
    "text": "to creating [a] new community center"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:36.880",
    "end": "00:03:39.549",
    "start_seconds": 216.88,
    "end_seconds": 219.549,
    "text": "where elderly people and their families"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:39.549",
    "end": "00:03:41.926",
    "start_seconds": 219.549,
    "end_seconds": 221.926,
    "text": "get some advice on wellness."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:42.802",
    "end": "00:03:46.431",
    "start_seconds": 222.802,
    "end_seconds": 226.43099999999998,
    "text": "Some people say monetary gifts are a kind of symbol of respect."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:47.348",
    "end": "00:03:48.975",
    "start_seconds": 227.348,
    "end_seconds": 228.975,
    "text": "So some people argued"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:49.017",
    "end": "00:03:52.979",
    "start_seconds": 229.017,
    "end_seconds": 232.97899999999998,
    "text": "that I had no respect for elderly people."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:53.480",
    "end": "00:03:55.190",
    "start_seconds": 233.48,
    "end_seconds": 235.19,
    "text": "But through the dialogue sessions,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:55.190",
    "end": "00:03:58.443",
    "start_seconds": 235.19,
    "end_seconds": 238.44299999999998,
    "text": "I explained why this was important"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:58.485",
    "end": "00:04:03.114",
    "start_seconds": 238.485,
    "end_seconds": 243.114,
    "text": "and why this actually benefited for elderly people."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:04.115",
    "end": "00:04:08.578",
    "start_seconds": 244.115,
    "end_seconds": 248.578,
    "text": "And I also cut my future monetary gift."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:09.162",
    "end": "00:04:12.665",
    "start_seconds": 249.162,
    "end_seconds": 252.665,
    "text": "So this was not like others’ problem;"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:12.707",
    "end": "00:04:14.334",
    "start_seconds": 252.707,
    "end_seconds": 254.334,
    "text": "this was our problem."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:14.876",
    "end": "00:04:18.546",
    "start_seconds": 254.876,
    "end_seconds": 258.546,
    "text": "Finally, they (came to) understand why we needed to change."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:19.047",
    "end": "00:04:25.178",
    "start_seconds": 259.047,
    "end_seconds": 265.178,
    "text": "They changed their opinion because they understood the process."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:26.221",
    "end": "00:04:30.517",
    "start_seconds": 266.221,
    "end_seconds": 270.517,
    "text": "During cherry blossom season, when cherry blossoms bloom beautifully,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:30.558",
    "end": "00:04:34.062",
    "start_seconds": 270.558,
    "end_seconds": 274.062,
    "text": "local shops wanted to close the street"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:34.062",
    "end": "00:04:38.024",
    "start_seconds": 274.062,
    "end_seconds": 278.024,
    "text": "to enjoy food under the cherry blossoms."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:38.024",
    "end": "00:04:41.986",
    "start_seconds": 278.024,
    "end_seconds": 281.986,
    "text": "But for local residents, that proposal was simply inconvenient,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:42.362",
    "end": "00:04:43.947",
    "start_seconds": 282.362,
    "end_seconds": 283.947,
    "text": "so it was controversial."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:44.781",
    "end": "00:04:51.371",
    "start_seconds": 284.781,
    "end_seconds": 291.371,
    "text": "But when local citizens and local shops actually joined the process"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:51.412",
    "end": "00:04:54.749",
    "start_seconds": 291.412,
    "end_seconds": 294.749,
    "text": "and citizens proposed the plan,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:54.749",
    "end": "00:04:57.001",
    "start_seconds": 294.749,
    "end_seconds": 297.001,
    "text": "the proposal was a success."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:57.585",
    "end": "00:05:02.131",
    "start_seconds": 297.585,
    "end_seconds": 302.131,
    "text": "So citizens actually created the vision of (our) town,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:02.173",
    "end": "00:05:03.508",
    "start_seconds": 302.173,
    "end_seconds": 303.508,
    "text": "not the government."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:04.467",
    "end": "00:05:06.052",
    "start_seconds": 304.467,
    "end_seconds": 306.052,
    "text": "People tend to think"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:06.094",
    "end": "00:05:09.848",
    "start_seconds": 306.094,
    "end_seconds": 309.848,
    "text": "that the ones who make society better are the government"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:09.889",
    "end": "00:05:11.808",
    "start_seconds": 309.889,
    "end_seconds": 311.808,
    "text": "or someone else."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:11.850",
    "end": "00:05:13.351",
    "start_seconds": 311.85,
    "end_seconds": 313.351,
    "text": "and not ourselves."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:13.935",
    "end": "00:05:16.145",
    "start_seconds": 313.935,
    "end_seconds": 316.145,
    "text": "I want to change that mindset."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:16.604",
    "end": "00:05:18.231",
    "start_seconds": 316.604,
    "end_seconds": 318.231,
    "text": "It is everyone."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:18.565",
    "end": "00:05:21.943",
    "start_seconds": 318.565,
    "end_seconds": 321.943,
    "text": "It's every single person who can make society better"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:21.985",
    "end": "00:05:24.988",
    "start_seconds": 321.985,
    "end_seconds": 324.988,
    "text": "and who can contribute to making society better."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:24.988",
    "end": "00:05:26.656",
    "start_seconds": 324.988,
    "end_seconds": 326.656,
    "text": "That is what I want to do."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:30.368",
    "end": "00:05:31.578",
    "start_seconds": 330.368,
    "end_seconds": 331.578,
    "text": "Thank you."
  }
]
